`), `dashboard/web/static/{map.js,dashboard.css,dashboard.html}`, `tests/test_dashboard_catalog.py`.\n50\t- **Design call:** the seed `_map.html` uses **CDN D3** (breaks offline-local serving); built a **dependency-free 2-ring SVG sunburst** instead â€” inner=kind, outer=domain colored by mean taste, sized by count, red-outlined where dead links exist; hover tooltip + click-to-filter. Reuses the visual idiom, keeps the dashboard offline-safe and portable.\n51\t- **Correctness:** latest-per-artifact CTEs dedupe embeddings + link_health so counts never inflate; retired excluded; NULL domain_path â†’ \"unclassified\"; mean taste NULL-aware; usage = hh loaded-count.\n52\t- **Live smoke:** 74 kindÃ—domain groups over 868 serving artifacts; wedge click lists taste-ordered artifacts (archive-crawler top of agent/knowledge-work>research).\n53\t- **Gate:** 45 passed (+5), 1029 deselected. All 6 static assets serve 200.\n54\t\n55\t### Wave 6 â€” Polish, embeddability proof, docs (+ deferred-graph note) â€” âœ… GREEN (2026-06-11)\n56\t\n57\t- **Status:** converged with 1 fix-iteration (real launcher bug); committed `1b84864`.\n58\t- **Files:** `aurora_dashboard.py` (_safe_print encoding guard), `tests/test_dashboard_web.py` (+embeddability-all-routes, +no-writes session, +launcher regression), `docs/foreman-handoff-dashboard/DASHBOARD.md` (new).\n59\t- **Embeddability (PM2):** `test_embeddability_every_route_on_bare_flask` mounts the blueprint on a bare host app and exercises all 10 `/api/*` routes â€” full Anchor-tab boundary, not just liveness.\n60\t- **Read-only (hard constraint #1):** hermetic no-writes test + live smoke both prove KB/report mtimes unchanged after a full session.\n61\t- **Real bug caught by live boot (the test client missed it):** the launcher banner crashed on a cp1252 console (UnicodeEncodeError on âœ¦/â”€). Fixed with an ASCII fallback + regression test; server now boots under cp1252 and serves every panel (index 200, morning/health/catalog all correct 