{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01EaCA1R2J7M83RyUKEkx4r9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## foreman-handoff-dashboard â€” build trio session summary\n\nGrounded in `docs/foreman-handoff-dashboard/` (Crucible Stage-0 framing + Foreman execution log; `foreman.config.json` binds the doc-trio: DESCRIPTION â†’ IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN â†’ EXECUTION-LOG).\n\n**Framing (Crucible, 2026-06-11)**\n- North Star: a **locally-served, read-only web dashboard** giving John one morning view of Aurora's nightly fleet â€” results + health + cost at a glance, plus a visual catalog explorer â€” so he never reads raw JSON/markdown to know what the fleet found, cost, and broke.\n- Two co-equal jobs locked: **the morning glance** and **the catalog explorer**; architecture (clean, **Anchor-embeddable module**) was made a co-equal North-Star criterion, not just the view.\n- Three gaps resolved by John before Stage 1: **G1** ship the hierarchical taxonomy map in v1, defer the force-directed graph; **G2** live read-on-request (no static snapshot); **G3** errors/health is its own first-class wave with in-page drill-down.\n- Hard constraints carried into the build: **read-only** against `kb/aurora.db` + `reports/` (PM3), **never reads `.env`/secrets** (C5), **embeddable blueprint boundary** (PM2), port **5001** bound to `127.0.0.1`.\n\n**Build (Foreman, all 6 waves GREEN, 2026-06-11)**\n- **W1** â€” read-only scaffold + data layer + serving shell (`dca46d7`). `db.ro_connect` uses `mode=ro` + `PRAGMA query_only=ON`; verified INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/CREATE all raise, and the **live WAL KB mtime was unchanged** after a full session (967 raw / 868 serving rows read). Installed Flask 3.1.3 into gitignored `.venv`.\n- **W2** â€” morning glance panel (`6d38b81`). `/api/morning` returns summary + briefing + weekly + cost rollup; degrades soft on missing `latest_summary.json`. Live: productivity 23.8% (n=21), top finds archive-crawler/benchmark-due-diligence/academic-verify, costs nightly $1.02 Â· MTD anthropic $10.12 Â· project $21.11.\n- **W3** â€” errors/health panel (`20fa1eb`). Signals (degrade, noise, backfills, rejects, logs) each expand in-page. **Security:** `sweep_log_tail` allowlists bare `*.log` within logs/+reports/; path traversal and live `.env` tail refused (verified no leak).\n- **W4** â€” per-sweep \"what was new\" browser (`af5822e`). `/api/sweeps` + `/api/sweep/<kind>/<date>` with kind/date allowlisting; morning find-chips deep-link via `#sweeps:<kind>`.\n- **W5** â€” catalog taxonomy map (`e420c4a`). Replaced the seed's **CDN D3** (breaks offline serving) with a **dependency-free 2-ring SVG sunburst** (inner=kind, outer=domain, color=mean taste, size=count, red outline = dead links); latest-per-artifact CTEs dedupe so counts never inflate. Live: 74 kindÃ—domain groups over 868 artifacts.\n- **W6** â€” polish + embeddability proof + docs (`1b84864`). `test_embeddability_every_route_on_bare_flask` exercises all 10 `/api/*` routes on a bare host app. **Real bug caught only by live boot:** launcher banner crashed on a cp1252 console (Unicode `âœ¦/â”€`) â€” fixed with ASCII fallback + regression test.\n\n**Outcome**\n- Project DONE: all 6 waves converged with **0â€“1 fix-iterations each**; **48 hermetic dashboard tests**, full suite **1077 passed** (1029 existing + 48), zero regressions, ~72s.\n- Run: `.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe aurora_dashboard.py` â†’ http://127.0.0.1:5001.\n- **Deferred (named, not built):** force-directed knowledge graph (documented in `DASHBOARD.md`, per Stage-0 G1).\n\nA caveat worth flagging: these claims are grounded in the session's own self-reported execution log, not an independent re-run â€” the test counts, commit SHAs, and live-smoke numbers are as Foreman recorded them."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8000,"cache_read_input_tokens":33388,"cache_creation":{"ephemera